# host_yilin — Host container usage notes
# Image: yilin-host (P1/docker-images/host/Dockerfile)
# Adapters: 1 (eth0)
# Console: telnet (open from GNS3)
# Important: Do NOT configure any IP addresses inside the image by default.
# When you build topologies in GNS3, assign IPs per-topology. Example runtime steps:
#
#   # start node in GNS3, open console
#   ip addr           # verifies eth0 exists, no IP by default
#   ip addr add 192.0.2.1/24 dev eth0
#   ip link set eth0 up
#   ping 192.0.2.2    # test ping to router
#
# Host node naming convention: use your login in the node name.
# Example: `host_yilin` (where `yilin` is your login).
